## 🆕 Feature #2: "Needs Your Attention" Section

### **Prominent Orange Alert Panel:**

Shows critical items requiring action at the top of Overview dashboard.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ ⚠️ NEEDS YOUR ATTENTION                          │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 🔴 Board Certification expired - Renewal required│
│    Emergency Medicine certification (ABEM #53460)│
│    Expired Dec 21, 2023                          │
│                            [Upload Renewal →]    │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 🟠 DEA Registration verification pending         │
│    Primary source verification needed (3 tokens) │
│    Required for privileging                      │
│                            [Verify Now →]        │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 🟠 Missing CAQH Provider ID                      │
│    Required for NCQA compliance                  │
│    Needed for packet completion                  │
│                            [Request Info →]      │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Attention Levels:**
- 🔴 **Critical** (Red icon): Overdue items, expired credentials
- 🟠 **High** (Amber icon): Urgent but not overdue
- 🔵 **Info** (Blue icon): General notices

**Features:**
- Orange border makes it impossible to miss
- Shows up to 5 items (with "View All" if more)
- Action buttons for each item
- Urgency-based icons and colors
- Displays due dates/deadlines

**Empty State:**
When nothing needs attention:
```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ ✓ All caught up!                                 │
│   No items need your attention right now.        │
