## 🆘 Troubleshooting

**Issue: Tour panel doesn't appear on left**
- Clear browser cache
- Hard refresh (Ctrl+Shift+R)
- Check browser console for errors

**Issue: Can't interact with prototype**
- Tour panel should NOT block clicks
- Try clicking further right on screen
- Minimize tour panel if needed

**Issue: Attention section not visible**
- Go to Dashboard (Overview)
- Scroll to top
- Should appear after Provider Info card

**Issue: Orange section is green instead**
- This means no urgent items (all caught up)
- Expected if urgentItems array is empty

